pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: nav-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: nav-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 0, 400, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$white"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>07 具体方案/方法细节</p>
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 55, 900, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>FPGA 资源成本与 Timing</strong></p>
  - elementId: intro
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 110, 1160, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>来自 Vivado post-implementation routed report：</p>
  - elementId: resource-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [60, 160, 700, 200]
    columnWidths: [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25]
    rowHeights: [0.17, 0.17, 0.17, 0.17, 0.17, 0.15]
    style: "$default"
    rows:
      - - content: {text: "Resource"}
        - content: {text: "Baseline"}
        - content: {text: "Trace-enabled"}
        - content: {text: "Delta"}
      - - content: {text: "LUT"}
        - content: {text: "84,923"}
        - content: {text: "106,428"}
        - content: {text: "+25.32%"}
      - - content: {text: "FF"}
        - content: {text: "56,491"}
        - content: {text: "65,634"}
        - content: {text: "+16.18%"}
      - - content: {text: "BRAM18"}
        - content: {text: "108"}
        - content: {text: "114"}
        - content: {text: "+5.56%"}
      - - content: {text: "DSP"}
        - content: {text: "27"}
        - content: {text: "27"}
        - content: {text: "+0%"}
      - - content: {text: "Timing"}
        - content: {text: "—"}
        - content: {text: "MET"}
        - content: {text: "slack 0.177 ns"}
  - elementId: boundary-note-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 380, 1160, 80]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FEF3C7"
  - elementId: boundary-note-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 390, 1120, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p><strong>边界说明</strong>：这是静态 FPGA resource 增量，不是 cycle-level runtime overhead。生产环境的 runtime overhead 尚未 claim。</p>
  - elementId: next-steps-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 480, 1160, 140]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [4000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$light"
  - elementId: next-steps-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 490, 400, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>下一步建议</strong></p>
  - elementId: next-steps-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 525, 1120, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>短期</strong>：按 scoped claim 提交 artifact，完成 figures、source citations、scoped disclosures、reproducibility path</p>
        <p><strong>中期</strong>：请 1–2 位 reviewer 按 artifact package 复查 evidence root 和 checker suite</p>
        <p><strong>长期</strong>：deployment overhead、streaming/DMA、real malware generalization 留作下一阶段</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 680, 400, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>RV-MalTrace 深度技术汇报</p>
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1180, 680, 60, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>38</p>
